# MiMo-V2.6-Flash-MOPD a4 + DFlash (4-token drafts, adaptive 1.2) + 64K draft vocab, on the unified build. 196K q8_0 ctx, ub 2048.
# Chat 31.0 / code 39.7 / edits 50.6 tok/s, decode 27.7 @32K (+8 / +13 / +16 / +10% vs the a8c9a4e7c build); KLD unchanged,
# needle 15/15 @81K, agentic 5/5 (2026-10-16, mimo/README.md). n3 for chat-heavy use, n5-6 for edit-heavy use. No ngram-mod (edits -18%).
# Set as env vars: GGML_VK_FA_WAVE32=1 GGML_VK_FA_KV_SLICE=8192 LLAMA_SPEC_ADAPTIVE=1.2
MODEL_SOURCE="-m /models/MiMo-V2.6-Flash-MOPD-a4/MiMo-V2.6-Flash-MOPD-a4-00001-of-00003.gguf"
MODEL_ALIAS=xiaomi/MiMo-V2.6-Flash
# MODEL_IMAGE: a llama-server build of llama.cpp 529ac893e + patches/llama.cpp-halo (Vulkan)
# --cache-ram 8192 also passed the gate (MemAvailable min 11 GiB); agentic preset: add --reasoning off.
MODEL_ARGS="--n-gpu-layers 999 --flash-attn on -fit off --load-mode none --parallel 1 --ctx-size 196608 -ctk q8_0 -ctv q8_0 --ubatch-size 2048 --batch-size 2048 --cache-ram 0 --jinja --temp 1.0 --top-p 1.0 --top-k 20 --min-p 0.0 -md /models/MiMo-V2.6-Flash-MOPD-BPW2.5/dflash-MiMo-V2.6-Flash-MOPD-Q8_0.gguf -ngld 999 --spec-type draft-dflash --spec-draft-n-max 4 --spec-draft-vocab /models/MiMo-V2.6-Flash-MOPD-a4/mimo-dv-65536.bin"
